# Low-poly stylized horse head
# Face direction: +Z
# Up axis: +Y
# Units: arbitrary
# Vertices: 64
# Intended for flat shading / wireframe-style rendering
# Coordinate convention: +X right, +Y forward, +Z up
# Corrected from the original Y-up version by rotating +90 degrees around X

